<title>DUBAI: Saudi king meets Lebanon's Hariri.</title>
<headline>Saudi king meets Lebanon's Hariri.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>King Fahd of Saudi Arabia and Lebanon's Prime Minister Rafik al-Hariri discussed bilateral ties and regional developments on Sunday, state-run Saudi television reported.</p>
<p>Hariri, who has close links to Saudi Arabia's royal family, arrived in Riyadh late on Saturday, it added.</p>
